.TH PHX-HEALTHCHECK 1 "2026-09-09" "Phalanx Duel" "Phalanx Duel Local Tooling"
.SH NAME
phx-healthcheck \- probe application, database, and observability health
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B bin/phx-healthcheck
.RI [ environment | host:port ]
.RI [ --observability ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
Performs live HTTP probes against /health and /ready and reports database status.
With --observability, it also runs the complete observability surface check.
.SH EXAMPLES
.B bin/phx-healthcheck localhost:3001 --observability
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR phx (1),
.BR phx-demo-ctl (1)
